## Interface: 16001
## Title: Blind Tiger: Blood Pact data carry-over
## Notes: Blind Tiger used to be called Blood Pact. This small helper hands your saved Blood Pact data to Blind Tiger the first time you log in. After that you can switch it off or delete it.
